efusal, source, isolation, CLI or guidance verification purpose; field-level subdivisions would repeat those same observations. Correct the stale session-protocol module attribution on LLR-356 when re-attesting the completion mapping: the changed instructions reside in coordinator-cycle.\n\nCommands (read-only reads/searches and git diff/show/log inspected the specified range; no commit subjects, session logs or prior verdict files were used as evidence):\n\n- git rev-parse HEAD -> 57067b9fc6bf61f4d6c2f02353b38522989ecf49.\n- With GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES=C:/Projects/ai-template.wt/review-tmp/2026-10-22c-leg13/r1 and PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1: C:/Projects/ai-template/.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider -n 2 --basetemp C:/Projects/ai-template.wt/review-tmp/2026-10-22c-leg13/r1/sol/wi-961 tests/test_claude_transcripts.py tests/test_usage_ingest.py tests/test_usage_ingest_git.py tests/test_prompts.py tests/test_frame_context.py -> 122 passed in 8.11s.\n- C:/Projects/ai-template/.venv/Scripts/python.exe project-trajectory/scripts/check_trajectory.py --strict -> check_trajectory: clean (969 work item(s), 854 done (88%), 34 cancelled, graph acyclic). Exit 0.\n- trace.py --strict-integrity, through runpy with only docs/test/report.md redirected to the allowed external review directory -> Traceability: SN=31 SR=136 LLR=323 TC=350 orphans=0 integrity=0 verified-mechanized=128 verified-demonstrated=6 verified-attested=0 drafts=22 budgets=4 budget-findings=0 components=4 component-findings=0 interfaces=252 interface-findings=0 ac-advisories=1 paraphrase-advisories=2. Report -> docs\\\\\\\\test\\\\\\\\report.md. Exit 0. Actual report is sol/trace-report.md; no worktree report was written. An initial wrapper attempt failed before checks because its script import path omitted kitlib; corrected before the single instrument execution.\n- Python end-to-end probe: copy the unmodified CHAIN fixture to sol/handback-probe, invoke usage_ingest.main twice with its ses